{"ID":"20240515142932-w2655xa","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515142932-w2655xa","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142932-w2655xa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143357-92fcvds\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143357-92fcvds\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143357-92fcvds\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:432,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:432\u0026#125;","title":"107","type":"doc","updated":"20240515143357"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143357-92fcvds","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 915px;","id":"20240515143357-92fcvds","updated":"20240515143357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/01"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YL"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年約七八十歲，中等身材，背微凸 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/13"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診時長期服用Baby Aspirin導致輕微中風，左唇麻且左側無力，師先予小續命湯加減二劑，患者無大進步，二診時(2008/08/04)予炙甘草湯，病人服後狀況大有改善，依約來三診。脈仍時一止，但有力許多，體力、胃口、睡眠皆好轉，左側身麻已退，大便由便秘改善為日一行；心口痛減少，仍有一點點。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）體力：轉佳。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）胃口：轉佳。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）睡眠：轉佳。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）大便：日一行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）其他：心口痛減少，仍有些微疼痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有時一止，但有力許多。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌苔淡黃"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炙甘草湯證"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同二診方(2008/08/04炙甘草湯加減)，加川芎三錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"予五付，每付九煮成三碗，早晚餐飯前服用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎可活血，可走到腦部，又可增加血管彈性，不像Aspirin反而會導致腦出血中風。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炙甘草湯既然中病，就要守方。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二診所開炙甘草湯並無攻下藥，連火麻仁都去掉了，但服後大便卻能暢行，這是因為心臟力量回復，進而使小腸蠕動速度加快，所以大便就因而通暢了。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}